WEBVTT

NOTE Spoken in Hindi; these are English subtitles.

00:00.000 --> 00:03.040
In the past three months, my daughter has improved a lot.

00:03.040 --> 00:05.280
She has got good marks.

00:05.280 --> 00:07.520
Hello everyone.

00:07.520 --> 00:13.200
A few months ago, I got my daughter admitted to Rise Academy.

00:13.200 --> 00:15.520
My daughter was very slow and weak in her studies.

00:15.520 --> 00:22.840
I wondered whether she would manage, but then I learned about Rise Academy here

00:22.840 --> 00:28.800
and about Ravil Sir. I asked his students about him,

00:28.800 --> 00:32.800
felt he was very good, and gave it a chance with my daughter.

00:32.800 --> 00:37.300
In three months, my daughter has improved a lot.

00:37.300 --> 00:39.300
She has got good marks.

00:39.300 --> 00:42.300
I never even thought she would get such good marks.

00:42.300 --> 00:47.000
I want all parents …

00:47.000 --> 00:50.000
… to please visit Rise Academy.

00:50.000 --> 00:51.000
Their platform is very good.

00:51.000 --> 00:55.000
They teach and guide the children very well.
